  "description": "The Grave of Charmylos is a third-century BCE vaulted tomb located on Kos. The site is understood as a hero\u00f6n dedicated to the legendary king Charmylos. The ancient site was dismantled and partially reused in the church of T\u00edmios St\u00e1vros.",
